ber) | 41.28 g (electrolyte excluded — parameter set has no electrolyte density); incl. electrolyte estimate 49.30 g | [O] r7_final_energy_dfn.json:mass_kg; [E] electrolyte |\n| Electrolyte formulation (final transport overrides) | σ = 1.7 S/m (constant), D = 5e-10 m²/s (constant), t⁺ = 0.45 (baseline: Nyman2008 c,T-dependent σ/D, t⁺ = 0.2594). Values = literature-class transport overrides **[E]**, recorded as estimates | r6_combo-v5-final_params.json |\n| Cation transference number | 0.45 (final) | r6_combo-v5-final_params.json |\n\n## 2. Electrodes and separator\n\n| Layer | Thickness | Porosity | Density | AM volume fraction | Particle radius (final) | Collector / substrate |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Positive (NMC811) | 75.6 µm | 0.335 | 3262 kg/m³ | 0.665 | **2.5 µm** (baseline 5.22 µm) | Al 16 µm, 2700 kg/m³ |\n| Negative (graphite) | 85.2 µm | **0.40** (baseline 0.25) | 1657 kg/m³ | 0.75 | **2.0 µm** (baseline 5.86 µm) | Cu 12 µm, 8960 kg/m³ |\n| Separator | 12 µm | 0.47 | (effective layer 0.210 kg/m²·mm per [O]) | — | — | — |\n\nAll values [P] except the 3 bolded overrides (r6_combo-v5-final_params.json).\n\n**N/P ratio** (per protocol formula): negative areal capacity ÷ positive areal capacity,\nareal capacity = c_max × AM volume fraction × thickness × F/3600:\n- Positive full-range 85.03 Ah/m²; negative 56.74 Ah/m² → **N/P = 0.667** (full-range basis) [D]\n- Usable-window basis: 5.0 Ah design window over positive 8.73 Ah full-range (fraction 0.573) → **N/P ≈ 1.166** [D]\n- (Mechanically derived from [P] c_max values 63104/33133 mol/m³; functional safety judgment is the 4C plating simulation result, §5.)\n\n## 3. Process design parameters\n\n| Parameter | Value | Formula | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Positive areal density | 163.99 g/m² | thickness × (1−porosity) × density | [D], eq. [O] r7_final_energy_dfn.json:layer_kg_m2.positive_electrode |\n| Negative areal density | 84.71 g/m² | ditto | [D], [O] layer_kg_m2.negative_electrode |\n| Positive compaction density | 2.169 g/cm³ | density × (1−porosity) ÷ 1000 | [D] |\n| Negative compaction density | 0.994 g/cm³ | ditto | [D] |\n| Electrolyte fill amount | 8.02 g/cell (78.05 g/m²), fill factor 1.0 | pore volume × 1.2 g/cm³ | [D]; electrolyte density 1.2 g/cm³ = literature default **[E]** |\n| Formation recommendation | 0.1C CC to 4.2 V, 25 °C, 2 cycles | design-recommended value; actual production-line protocol requires tuning | recommendation |\n\n## 4. Mass breakdown (contract caliber)\n\n| Component | Mass (g) | kg/kWh | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Positive coating | 16.842 | 0.913 | [O] layer_kg_m2 × area (0.1027 m²) |\n| Negative coating | 8.699 | 0.471 | [O] |\n| Al current collector | 4.437 | 0.240 | [O] |\n| Cu current collector | 11.042 | 0.598 | [O] |\n| Separator | 0.259 | 0.014 | [O] |\n| **Total (electrolyte excluded — contract caliber)** | **41.280** | 2.237 | [O] mass_kg |\n| Electrolyte (estimate) | 8.016 | 0.434 | [E]/[D] |\n| Total incl. electrolyte | 49.296 | 2.671 | [D] |\n\nEnergy 18.457 Wh → 0.018457 kWh [O] r7_final_energy_dfn.json:energy_wh.\n\n## 5. Performance verification (vs criteria entry 0)\n\n| Metric | Threshold | Final value | Judgment | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Gravimetric energy density | ≥ 327.18 Wh/kg | 447.12 Wh/kg (895.02 Wh/L) | ✓ PASS | [O] r7_final_energy_dfn.json:energy_density_wh_kg |\n| 4C fast charge — lithium plating | plated = false | anode_potential_v min = +0.0443 V → **no plating** | ✓ PASS | [O] r7_final_4c_dfn.json:anode_potential_v |\n| SEI thickness @ 100 cyc 1C | ≤ 500 nm | 276.22 nm | ✓ PASS | [O] r6_combo-v5-final_aging100_spme.json:sei_thickness_nm_end (params identical to DFN set) |\n| −20 °C discharge retention | ≥ 90 % | 99.57 % | ✓ PASS | [O] r7_final_lowT_retention.json:lowT_retention |\n| SEI thickness @ 500 cyc 1C | ≤ 550 nm | 393.00 nm | ✓ PASS | [O] r6_combo-v5-final_aging500_spme.json:sei_thickness_nm_end |\n| 1C discharge capacity | (nominal 5.0 Ah set) | 5.0648 Ah (DFN) | info | [O] r7_final_1c_dfn.json:capacity_ah |\n| 4C charge T_max | no threshold in contract | 347.70 K (+29.55 K vs 318.15 K ambient, lumped thermal, h = 10 W/m²K) | info | [O] r7_final_4c_dfn.json:T_max_K |\n| DCR / power density | info | 2.612 mΩ / 39.08 kW/kg | info | [O] r7_final_energy_dfn.json |\n\n**Baseline → final comparison** (same system, same protocols): ED 400.29 → 447.12 Wh/kg; SEI@100 449.1 → 276.2 nm; SEI@500 777.9 → 393.0 nm; lowT 0.9943 → 0.9957; 4C plating **plated → no plating**. (Baseline values: log entry 4 evidence, r1_base_* outputs.)\n\n## 6. Design notes — changes vs baseline and why\n\nDiagnosis chain (r2→r6, from log propose/evaluate entries): the round-1 gap vector showed only two failures — SEI@500 (777.9 vs 550 nm) and 4C plating (anode min −0.438 V). Attribution by single-lever variants:\n\n| # | Lever (baseline → final) | Reason (log trace) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Positive particle radius 5.22 → 2.5 µm | R3: 4C charge clipped by the 4.2 V cut-off at ~28 s — cathode-surface saturation from slow solid diffusion is the acceptance blocker |\n| 2 | Negative particle radius 5.86 → 2.0 µm | R2/R4: plating margin via finer anode kinetics |\n| 3 | σ: Nyman2008 → 1.7 S/m const; D → 5e-10; t⁺ 0.2594 → 0.45 | R2/R6: transport formulation (literature-class **[E]**) closes the last 25 mV anode dip; ED-neutral lever class |\n| 4 | Negative porosity 0.25 → 0.40 | R6: at 20 A the thick anode shows local Li⁺ depletion (electrolyte path); porosity raises in-electrode transport |\n| 5 | SEI k 1e-12 → 2e-13 m/s and SEI molar volume V̄ 9.585e-5 → 4.7925e-5 m³/mol | R3–R5 attribution: k×0.2 and D_ec×0.1 were near-ineffective on SEI@500 (ohmic-shut-off regime); R_sei ×3 works on SEI but adds ~0.4 V anode IR at 4C → rejected; **V̄×0.5 scales final thickness linearly with zero IR side effect** → chosen. Values **[E]** (SEI-suppressing-coating bridge, dense-inorganic-SEI class) |\n| (explored, rejected) | R_sei ×3/×10; thicker negative; pos porosity etc. | recorded in log r4/r5 evaluations |\n\nAll final values verified at DFN precision (round 7: 1C DFN, 4C DFN, lowT DFN, calc-energy DFN; aging kept SPMe per protocol standard). True DFT/MD endorsement skipped — `real_compute=false` per entry 0 meta."}
